  "bodyHash": "iOnfXHVfOK0=",
  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/vb0sHHl.png\" width=\"840\" height=\"105\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/9dNdR6j.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"115\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f60\">*** 需前置<a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shetiphiancore\" rel=\"nofollow\">ShetiPhianCore</a>模组！ ***</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">自由组合任意两种方块或物品（支持原版与模组）打造专属储物容器</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">若合成材料具有发光特性，成品容器也会继承该特性</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/GUD6aKK.png\" width=\"640\" height=\"70\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>堆叠式储物箱</strong></span></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">最高可堆叠三层，每层提供27格储物空间（可升级）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">相邻容器将共享物品存储空间</span><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/754/685/stacking-storage-crop.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"650\" height=\"419\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/GUD6aKK.png\" width=\"640\" height=\"70\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>杂物抽屉柜</strong></span></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">每个抽屉独立存取，提供32格容量（可升级）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">单次仅显示16格物品栏</span></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/754/690/junk-box-crop.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"650\" height=\"389\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/GUD6aKK.png\" width=\"640\" height=\"70\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>队列箱子</strong></span></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">物品以队列形式存储，仅能从首尾进行存取</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">基础容量4096件物品（可升级为按堆叠计算）</span></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/754/693/queue-crop.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"650\" height=\"233\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/GUD6aKK.png\" width=\"640\" height=\"70\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>储物可视化器</strong></span></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">放置于容器上可快速存取指定物品</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">作为独立方块时可充当简易物品展示框</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\">左键单击=取1件，Shift+左键=取整组，右键=放入手持物品，空手双击右键=放入所有匹配物品</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\">Shift+右键=将手持物品加入过滤器，空手Shift+右键=从过滤器移除手持物品</span></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/293/visualizer-crop.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"650\" height=\"395\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/GUD6aKK.png\" width=\"640\" height=\"70\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>变色龙储物箱</strong></span></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可拟态为其他方块，内置12格储物空间（可升级）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">使用扳手快速设置拟态对象（参见下方GIF）</span></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/756/260/hidden-storage-crop-f.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"314\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/GUD6aKK.png\" width=\"640\" height=\"70\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>升级组件</strong></span></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">提升各类容器的存储容量</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">手持升级件时按住Shift可高亮适用容器，右键进行安装</span></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/827/upgrades-crop.png\" width=\"650\" height=\"242\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/GUD6aKK.png\" width=\"640\" height=\"70\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>工具</strong></span></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">扳手用于调整容器配置（参见下方GIF）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">工作台用于制作本模组所有物品</span></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/826/tools-crop.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"465\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/GUD6aKK.png\" width=\"640\" height=\"70\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>动态演示</strong></span></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2tRZ5gA.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"650\" height=\"359\"></p><p>&nbsp;<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/X5kNfHp.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"650\" height=\"359\"></p><p>&nbsp;<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cCV9VSS.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"650\" height=\"359\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/GUD6aKK.png\" width=\"640\" height=\"70\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>本地化文件请提交至<a href=\"https://github.com/ShetiPhian/Localizations-and-Issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub仓库</a></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>错误报告请使用<a href=\"https://github.com/ShetiPhian/Localizations-and-Issues/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">问题追踪系统</a>，请勿在评论区提交</strong></p>",
